  "architecture": [
    "The existing NodeHost implements the shared Host trait. Node policy/state remains in quench-node; the shared Runtime owns execution.",
    "Host::initialize runs after intrinsics/native globals and before guest execution, with scoped roots and validated error transfer.",
    "NativeContext::object_rooted delegates to shared Object.create using the intrinsic realm prototype, without consulting mutable guest Object.",
    "ProcessState owns one monotonic origin initialized during logical process construction; both adapters call its uptime operation.",
    "Rust binding records own guest names/arity/callbacks; process property installation derives names from them. The JS uptime fallback and lazy global timer are removed.",
    "Callback/initializer failures preserve typed error metadata. Guest identities require validated roots; unrooted guest payloads are discarded."
  ],
